19:["$","section","method",{"id":"method","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"05"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Method & Worked Example"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"沿着输入、处理、输出走完 Pipeline。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"model 先基于原输入生成答案，再调用合适工具检查相关属性，将工具回执与批评接到初稿后重新生成。验证与修正循环重复，直到批评认为无需再改或达到轮数限制，全程采用 context 示例而非任务 fine-tuning。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: CRITIC: Large Language Models Can Self-Correct with Tool-Interactive Critiquing · v4","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"沿用原文算术与程序辅助检查场景作教学演示：初稿把若干金额相加算错，Critic 生成一个计算表达式，执行器返回真实结果，Model 对照结果指出错误并修改答案；之后再检查直到停止条件满足。输出是修订后的答案与工具轨迹，具体金额为教学构造。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: CRITIC: Large Language Models Can Self-Correct with Tool-Interactive Critiquing · v4","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1a:["$","section","mathematics",{"id":"mathematics","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"06"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Mathematical Foundations"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从符号、直觉与简单例子理解理论。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"把整个循环拆成 y_t→tool evidence→critique_t→y_(t+1)。工具可以提供新的信息，但 Model 仍需正确选择查询并解释结果，因此整体正确率受这几步共同限制。没有一个自动保证净收益的乘法公式；应分别测错误被修正和正确答案被破坏的频率。"}],["$","pre",null,{"className":"math-block","aria-label":"数学表达式","children":"e_t = Tool(query(x,y_t))\nc_t = Critique(x,y_t,e_t)\ny_(t+1) = Correct(x,y_t,c_t)"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: CRITIC: Large Language Models Can Self-Correct with Tool-Interactive Critiquing · v4","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1b:["$","section","experiments",{"id":"experiments","children":[[["$","span","results",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"results"}],["$","span","observation",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"observation"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"07"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Experiments & Claims"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"Research Question → Experiment → Answer"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Question：外部工具对自纠错是否关键？→ Experiment：在问答、数学与相关生成任务比较有无工具的 Critique，以及其它推理、采样基线。→ Answer：作者报告工具反馈带来收益；其检索实验还缓存结果以处理在线内容变化，说明环境可重复性属于评价的一部分。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: CRITIC: Large Language Models Can Self-Correct with Tool-Interactive Critiquing · v4","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"作者在自由形式问答、数学程序合成和文本毒性降低三类任务中报告改善，并强调 external feedback 的重要性。这些结果支持工具辅助的当前 Output Refinement，没有证明改正一次答案后，model 会永久掌握相应能力。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: CRITIC: Large Language Models Can Self-Correct with Tool-Interactive Critiquing · v4","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1c:["$","section","takeaways",{"id":"takeaways","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"08"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Takeaways"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"这篇论文改变了哪些判断？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"CRITIC 的机制价值是引入与初稿不同的信息源。外部来源依然可能错误，因此应保留检索内容和执行结果，不能只展示一段看起来可靠的 Critique。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: CRITIC: Large Language Models Can Self-Correct with Tool-Interactive Critiquing · v4","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1d:["$","section","assumptions",{"id":"assumptions","children":[[["$","span","limits",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"limits"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"09"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Most Fragile Assumption"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"哪一个假设失效会动摇方法？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"最脆弱的假设是工具反馈与目标事实相关且可信。搜到相似但不同对象、生成错误程序或误读单位，都可能让工具为错误答案提供伪支持。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: CRITIC: Large Language Models Can Self-Correct with Tool-Interactive Critiquing · v4","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"工具能够提供证据，但检索内容或自动评价也会有误差；实现中的工具选择由研究者按任务配置。无参数更新且没有跨任务经验保存，因此不能从迭代次数增加推断长期学习，更不能推断无界 self-improvement。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: CRITIC: Large Language Models Can Self-Correct with Tool-Interactive Critiquing · v4","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
1e:["$","section","reproduction",{"id":"reproduction","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"10"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"One-Week Reproduction"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"用一周检验一个最小且明确的命题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Day 1–2：准备 30 个可核验事实与计算问题，缓存工具结果。Day 3–5：比较同源 Critique、真实工具和打乱工具结果。Day 6–7：检查净纠错率、引用匹配和每题额外成本。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
1f:["$","section","counterexample",{"id":"counterexample","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"11"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Counterexample Design"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"如何构造有辨识力的反例？"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"给出名称相同的两个实体，令搜索优先返回错误实体。若 Critic 只因结果来自工具就提高自信并改错答案，便能暴露 Evidence Matching 的失败。"}],"$undefined",null]}]]]}]]}]
20:["$","section","follow-up",{"id":"follow-up","children":[[["$","span","outlook",{"className":"anchor-alias","id":"outlook"}]],["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"12"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Follow-up Research"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"从缺陷与需求推导新的研究问题。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-hypothesis","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-hypothesis","children":"Hypothesis"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"研究工具反馈的独立性预算：系统估计多个来源是否共享同一上游错误，并选择真正增加区分信息的下一次核验。相对 ReAct 的动态行动，这研究纠错中的证据依赖结构。关键实验是重复来源很多时，仍能避免把数量当作可信度。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","2303.17651",{"href":"#reference-2303.17651","aria-label":"来源 2: Self-Refine: Iterative Refinement with Self-Feedback","children":["[",2,"]"]}],["$","a","2210.03629",{"href":"#reference-2210.03629","aria-label":"来源 3: ReAct: Synergizing Reasoning and Acting in Language Models","children":["[",3,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
